    "detailed_description": "Our world, it\u2019s an awe inspiring, beautiful, vast place; with hundreds of castles, towns, villages forests and caves just waiting to be explored, and exploited. The rulers of Wessex, Mercia and The Danes dominate the land of Britannia their constant skirmishes are building to an all-out war as the Danes build the great pagan army and bring a second darkness to the land.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOutside their influence, mythical beasts roam the lands.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhether you want to trade for profit, take part in multiplayer co-op quests alliances, free-for-all group battles and team raids to bring down large beasts and monsters, even tip the balance of power in the kingdom (for your own advantage, of course.), or simply explore the wonders of Britannia (and who knows what you\u2019ll find out there...) is up to you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour second-to-second actions could have you taking the roles of trader, knight, bounty hunter, leader, team player, opportunistic assassin, grand schemer, and more. You are at the centre of the action any time, any place, and any way you choose \u2013 each action has a consequence and influences the world around you.<br />\r\nStarting with a few gold coins a name and a sword, carve your own path through the richest, large gaming sandbox ever created, set against a backdrop of feuding families, myths, and legends from medieval times.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo whatever it takes to build your house into a mighty royal family.",
    "about_the_game": "Our world, it\u2019s an awe inspiring, beautiful, vast place; with hundreds of castles, towns, villages forests and caves just waiting to be explored, and exploited. The rulers of Wessex, Mercia and The Danes dominate the land of Britannia their constant skirmishes are building to an all-out war as the Danes build the great pagan army and bring a second darkness to the land.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOutside their influence, mythical beasts roam the lands.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhether you want to trade for profit, take part in multiplayer co-op quests alliances, free-for-all group battles and team raids to bring down large beasts and monsters, even tip the balance of power in the kingdom (for your own advantage, of course.), or simply explore the wonders of Britannia (and who knows what you\u2019ll find out there...) is up to you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour second-to-second actions could have you taking the roles of trader, knight, bounty hunter, leader, team player, opportunistic assassin, grand schemer, and more. You are at the centre of the action any time, any place, and any way you choose \u2013 each action has a consequence and influences the world around you.<br />\r\nStarting with a few gold coins a name and a sword, carve your own path through the richest, large gaming sandbox ever created, set against a backdrop of feuding families, myths, and legends from medieval times.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo whatever it takes to build your house into a mighty royal family.",
    "short_description": "A third person medieval multiplayer RPG where you create your own legend, the story is unwritten, your destination is unknown, 50 gold in your pocket, a sword, and the wild lands in front.",
